# Blog posts/authors published to the CMS after the last build have no static file
# yet. Send those (and only those — existing static files/pages are served first,
# per host default) to the client-fetched fallback shell, which reads the slug from
# the URL and loads the content live from the CMS API. Keep in sync with .htaccess.
/authors/:slug    /author-live/   200
/:category/:slug  /blog-live/     200

